# The OpenAPI spec is generated from core/ (CI-06, issue 231). linguist-generated folds it in PR
# diffs, so reviewers read the API change in core/ instead of thousands of generated lines.
# Never hand-merge it. On a merge conflict: take either side, then run
#   make -C sdk openapi
# and commit what it writes. ci-sdk (`make -C sdk check-stale`) fails when it drifts from core/.
# The SDK code generated from it is not committed at all (CI-16, .gitignore; make -C sdk gen-code).
sdk/openapi/onemind-v1.json              linguist-generated=true
